{"kind": "mod", "id": 2274, "name": "Jiang Hu 江湖", "slug": "jiang-hu", "teaser": "Overhaul", "owner_name": "Hiokree", "downloads": 11093, "favourites": 2, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.hiokree.jianghu", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Overhauls", "category_id": 2, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T07:42:31.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-08-29T23:49:08.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-11-27T01:14:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.11", "latest_version": "16.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">🎄English</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"NWFS9wmGiJQ\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/NWFS9wmGiJQ?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NWFS9wmGiJQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>Overhaul of how Tarkov can be played</p>\n<h4><strong>🧮 In-Game User Interface</strong></h4>\n<p>For new players, after install:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Press F5 to open Game Manager, most of configure settings are there</li>\n<li>Press F12 and click “JiangHu”, some features are there</li>\n<li>Click “Description”, it has overall mod info</li>\n<li>All detailed guides have 7 languages versions</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>👥 Universal Bot Generator</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>One-click to spawn/remove any bot at any time, on any map, with any hostility</li>\n<li>Option to disable all default bot spawns: Play only with your own bot teammates, enemies, or neutrals</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>⚔️ Bot War &amp; Death match</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Click 「樂園」 button on the main menu to play alongside bot teammates, against multiple enemy bot teams, with your own bot roster (all bosses, PMCs, Rogue, etc), in death match mode, on all maps</li>\n<li>Switch to free camera mode to observe the bot battles, or switch back to rejoin the fight</li>\n<li>In free camera mode, select and place bots on the map, like arranging pieces on chessboard</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🍂 Random Map + Randow Transit + Hardcore mode &amp; Quest Type</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Click 「江湖」 button on the main menu to play, select map(s) in F5 game manager</li>\n<li>“Dance on the Razor’s Edge”: Energy &amp; Hydration drain at 1 point every 10 seconds + all boss kill XP reduced to 1000</li>\n<li>“Aporia” Quests: Reach high XP targets within a single raid while playing with both. rewards skill levels, can reset anytime to earn more levels</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🪽 New movement &amp; handling - Martial Arts</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Instant Response, Clean &amp; Smooth Movement</li>\n<li>Faster walk/sprint, stance transitions, leaning</li>\n<li>Sliding, Mid-Air Jump</li>\n<li>Faster weapon switching / aiming, no aimpunch</li>\n<li>Wider freelook</li>\n<li>Stellar Transposition: Instantly swap positions with any bot you are looking at</li>\n<li>Kung Fu Bot: As you master each martial art (in Physics), bots will learn and use it too</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🤖  Bot Highlight &amp; Marker</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>In normal raid, highlight &amp; mark bots by side, makes them clearly visible: green for teammates, red for enemies, white for neutral</li>\n<li>In Bot war &amp; Death match, highlight &amp; mark each team with unique color</li>\n<li>Can be toggled on/off anytime</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🌌 New UI</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>New main menu: rearrange buttons, add 2 new game mode buttons, removed “alpha warning”</li>\n<li>Background Selector: Set your video as dynamic background, or image as static background</li>\n<li>BGM Player: Set your music as BGM, can play in hideout and raid too</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdeUXs25Le9UhxbPdJS-iyXkDfURb1L7?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Jiang Hu Art DLC</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🎋 Battle Screen</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Show detailed damage stats after every hit: which body part was hit and took how much damage, which armor/helmet was hit and how much durability was lost, and how much damage absorbed by armor/helmet</li>\n<li>Kill record for each bot type: Scav, PMC, Boss, etc</li>\n<li>In death match: displays each team’s K/D</li>\n<li>Freely move and place the battle screen anywhere on the screen</li>\n<li>Scroll to view raid history, and Automatically saves a copy to a local log file in BepInEx\\plugins\\JiangHu.Client\\fight_log</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🔮 Dogtag Collection Quest Type</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>New bot names: select from myths, literature, folklore, movies, anime, etc</li>\n<li>Collect dogtags with specific nicknames to complete quests and recieve rewards</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🏯 New Items &amp; Trader</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>1×1 size containers that can hold ANYTHING, fits in ANY slot</li>\n<li>in-raid repair kits</li>\n<li>Other unique pristine supplies</li>\n<li>New Trader Buys ALL items at handbook price with roubles, giving you the best value and showing the true base value of every item</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🪄 Random Quest Generator</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Play randomized vanilla questlines</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>☯️ New Quest</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Jiang Hu Bounty: Eliminate ALL bosses in one single raid. This is the only path to Prestige. you may attempt it at any time, even at Level 1. If succeed, you will become a true Jiang Hu Da Xia and may prestige immediately</li>\n<li>9 Main Quests: replace the vanilla questline, focused and intensified experience</li>\n<li>Reward all around skill levels. all skills can reach elite level in 1 play through</li>\n<li>Cover all vanilla quest unlocks, and unlock them by category per quest, such as items, recipes, traders &amp; standings, customization</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🎮 New Game Settings</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Flea Market locked</li>\n<li>Early access to Kappa</li>\n<li>Cash Wipe on Death: Lose 10% of total cash each death, with the first 1 million always protected</li>\n<li>No Insurance: Traders stop offering insurance</li>\n<li>Eventually traders stop doing any bussiness with you at all, you must rely entirely on loot</li>\n<li>Your security container will be disabled</li>\n<li>And more</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🌸 Story mode &amp; Free Mode</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>In Story mode, start your journey as a Young Wanderer, take quests from the legendary Long Gate Inn, grow stronger, learn rare martial arts, earn powerful artifacts, and face increasingly dangerous challenges on your path toward the ultimate Jiang Hu Bounty</li>\n<li>Combines many features above — settings, quests, new movement systems, etc — to deliver a completely different gameplay experience</li>\n<li>In Free Mode, All features can be toggled on or off. turn all of them off will return to vanilla game. you can customize and explore your own Jiang Hu experience</li>\n<li>Recommended: use one profile for immersive story mode and one for free mode</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>📱 Install &amp; Use</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Just like all mods</li>\n<li>If playing with an existing profile, Back up your profile first</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">🧧 中文</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"NWFS9wmGiJQ\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/NWFS9wmGiJQ?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NWFS9wmGiJQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>塔科夫玩法的重造更新</p>\n<h4><strong>🧮 游戏内用户界面</strong></h4>\n<p>新手宝宝在安装模组后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按F5键打开游戏管理中心，大部分的设置都在那里</li>\n<li>按F12键点击“江湖”，那里也有一些重要功能</li>\n<li>点击“描述”，查看模组的综合介绍</li>\n<li>所有详细指南均有7国语言版本</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>👥 点将台</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>一键召唤/移除任何人机，任意地图，任何时间，任何敌友关系</li>\n<li>可选禁止系统刷人机，只与自定义的队友、敌人或中立人机一起玩</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>⚔️ 乐园</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>点击主菜单的「樂園」按钮，和人机队友一起，使用自定义的队伍阵容（所有头目、佣兵、反叛者等等），在所有地图上与多支人机队伍展开死斗混战</li>\n<li>可随时切换到自由视角观战，或切换回来加入战斗</li>\n<li>在自由视角下，可以选中并将人机放置在地图任何位置，就像下棋一样</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🍂  全新模式与任务类型</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>江湖行：随机地图 + 随机转图，点击主菜单的「江湖」按钮玩，在F5游戏管理器中选择地图</li>\n<li>惊鸿猎：能量与水分消耗调整为每10秒减少1点，击杀首领的经验统一下调至1000</li>\n<li>向阳而生：新任务类型，单次战局内达成高经验值目标，需开启“惊鸿猎”后点击“江湖”玩。奖励技能等级，可随时重置以获取更多等级</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🪽 凌波微步</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>瞬时响应、干净流畅的移动</li>\n<li>神行术：更快的行走/冲刺、姿态转换、侧身速度</li>\n<li>滑铲，半空跳跃</li>\n<li>更快的武器切换/瞄准，无瞄准受击晃动</li>\n<li>更宽的自由视角</li>\n<li>斗转星移：与视野中的任何目标瞬间互换位置</li>\n<li>功夫人机：随着你掌握每一门武功，人机也会学会并使用</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🤖 画皮</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>在普通战局中按阵营高亮人机身体以清晰识别：绿色为队友，红色为敌人，白色为中立</li>\n<li>在乐园死斗中用独特颜色高亮标记每支队伍</li>\n<li>可随时开启/关闭</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🌌 新用户界面</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>新主画面：重排按钮，新增2个新游戏模式按钮，移除“测试阶段警告”</li>\n<li>背景选择器：设置视频文件作为动态背景，或图片作为静态背景</li>\n<li>音乐播放器：设置音乐作为背景音乐，藏身处、局内也可播放</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdeUXs25Le9UhxbPdJS-iyXkDfURb1L7?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">江湖风格包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🎋 锋镝录</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>每次命中后显示详细伤害统计：命中部位及伤害值，命中的护甲/头盔及其损耗的耐久度，以及被护甲/头盔吸收的伤害值</li>\n<li>每种人机类型的击杀记录：拾荒者、佣兵、头目等</li>\n<li>在混战死斗模式中：显示每支队伍的击杀/死亡比</li>\n<li>可自由移动并放置锋镝录在屏幕任何位置</li>\n<li>滚动查看战局历史，并自动保存副本至本地日志文件 BepInEx\\plugins\\JiangHu.Client\\fight_log</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🔮 狗牌收集任务类型</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>新人机名字：从神话、文学、民间传说、流行文化（影视、动漫等）中选取的名字</li>\n<li>收集带有特定名字的狗牌以完成任务并获得奖励</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🏯 新物品与商人</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>1×1尺寸的神秘容器，可容纳任何物品、放在任何格子里</li>\n<li>战局内修理工具包</li>\n<li>其他独特的崭新补给品</li>\n<li>新商人“龙门客栈”以卢布按手册价格收购所有物品，提供最佳价值并显示每件物品的真实基础价值</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🪄 任务生成器</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>体验随机原版任务线</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>☯️ 新任务</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>江湖悬赏令：在单次战局中消灭所有头目。这是转生的唯一条件。你可以在任何时间尝试，即使只有1级。 若成功，你将成为真正的江湖大侠，并可立即转生</li>\n<li>9个主线任务：完整替代原版任务线，提供更紧凑刺激的游戏体验</li>\n<li>奖励全面技能等级：所有技能可以在一周目达到精英等级</li>\n<li>一任务全解锁：特定任务可解锁完整类别，如物品、制造配方、商人及好感度、藏身处装饰</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🎮 新游戏设置</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>跳蚤市场锁定</li>\n<li>早期即解锁Kappa</li>\n<li>死亡现金惩罚：每次死亡损失总现金10%，但保底100万</li>\n<li>无保险：商人停止提供保险</li>\n<li>最终商人会彻底停止交易，你必须完全依赖战局战利品来生存</li>\n<li>禁用安全箱</li>\n<li>以及更多</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>🌸 剧情模式与自由模式</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>在剧情模式中，开启萌新哈基米的旅程，从传奇的龙门客栈接取任务，逐渐变强，学习稀有武功，获得强大神器，应对日益艰险的挑战，最终剑指江湖悬赏令</li>\n<li>结合了前面介绍的众多功能——设置、任务、新移动系统等——提供全新的游戏体验</li>\n<li>在自由模式中，所有功能均可开关。关闭所有功能将回归原版游戏。你可以自定义并探索属于自己的江湖体验</li>\n<li>推荐：使用一个存档体验沉浸式剧情模式，另一个用于自由模式</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong>📱 安装及使用</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>和所有MOD的安装方法一样</li>\n<li>如果使用现有存档游玩，请首先备份你的存档</li>\n</ul>\n<hr /></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">🌐 languages</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>中文</li>\n<li>English</li>\n<li>Español</li>\n<li>Français</li>\n<li>日本語</li>\n<li>Português</li>\n<li>Русский</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">🌟 Credits 感谢</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>\n<p>BSG, SPT project and the community</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Virtual’s “VCQL”, Bobby Renzobbi’s “Bobby’s Music Player”, Devraccoon’s “Environment Replace”, acidphantasm’s “Scorpion”, VAFELZ and Tiltushkin’s “All Ammo Trader”, Hood’s “More Energy Drinks”, ragnaroks’s “sptarkovammocraft”, crustyselenium_‘s “Flea Market Quests”, desze’s “Unlock All Hideout Customization”, VioletAmbush’s “VAI: Rogue-Lite Tarkov Project 1.1.1”, DrakiaXYZ’s “NoBossPMCs”, saryn’s “Oops.AllBossPMC”, Terkoiz’s “Skipper”, Chazu’s “[TTC] Tarkov Trading Cards”, harmony’s “Bot Callsigns - Reloadedand”, jbs